  "referenceNumber": "RUS2084",
  "remarks": "\nBEKS SHIP MANAGEMENT AND TRADING is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following ground: BEKS SHIP MANAGEMENT AND TRADING is involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia through carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector. \n",
